Subject: [PATCH] docs: development starts from the baseline; the unreleased
 changelog entry

DEVELOPMENT.md is rewritten around a baseline-first loop (state the
change as a baseline difference, read the named diff, fix or accept on
purpose with a declared loss and a qualifier record, cite the snapshots
in the piece record, just ci), credits the foundation it builds on
(#81, 7a51195, #86, #87, #85), and lists what the baseline does not
reach. CHANGELOG.md gets one unreleased section for what wip carries.
